ARC-AGI task data

This repository contains tasks from these datasets:

- ARC-AGI-1, https://github.com/fchollet/ARC-AGI. Copyright 2019 Francois Chollet.
- ARC-AGI-2, https://github.com/arcprize/ARC-AGI-2. Copyright 2019 ARC Prize Foundation.

Both datasets are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt. Each file in this repository that contains tasks or grids from these datasets is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

These files are changed from the upstream data:

- data/tasks/ holds the upstream tasks with corrections applied. data/patches/ holds the corrections.
- Other files hold the tasks, or parts of them, in other formats.
